::::'''Herta:''' {{Rubi|Screwllum|Genius Society #76}} went up against the Stellaron Hunters before. I heard there was a member whose hacking skills were on par with Screwllum.
::::'''Herta:''' Being on the same level as Screwllum &mdash; who's probably the best in the universe &mdash; is nothing short of spectacular. It's beyond my abilities, computers are not my forte.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
