;(Talk to Herta)
:'''Herta:''' What's up? I'll only answer questions about the Simulated Universe.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Simulated Universe project...
::'''Herta:''' Got some questions?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} How is it going to answer the mystery of the Aeons?
:::'''Herta:''' Oh, in layman's terms, it will simulate the Aeons THEMSELVES. Then we can ask THEM questions.
:::'''Herta:''' The society has pulled a lot of strings and diverted a lot of resources to make this project happen... The false Aeons we have simulated are connected with real ones, so you can say we have basically created a bunch of powerless mini Aeons.
:::'''Herta:''' Of course, if you want to get to the nitty-gritty, it's not that simple... This project has encountered plenty of hiccups along the way. It wasn't all smooth sailing.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} You said there are other partners?
:::'''Herta:''' Well, the project was jointly launched by four members of our society. There's Ruan Mei, a master in the field of creation. She cultivated the protoplasm simulating the Aeons. There's Screwllum, the famous mechanical aristocrat, who is responsible for writing the underlying logic of the program and the algorithm for the galaxy.
:::'''Herta:''' There's me, Herta, who is responsible for providing the venue, personnel, resources, and adding some interesting systems to the project. There's also Stephen&mdash; oh, um, he wants to keep it a secret, so... forget about him.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why do you need me?
:::'''Herta:''' Well, because you're special... You have a Stellaron in your body. You're living the life of a trailblazer, and even Nanook took a glance at you. So the Aeons may be more willing to accept you.
:::'''Herta:''' You know, the Aeons have no concept of free will at all. THEY think about nothing but the destined Path. So, when we asked THEM questions, THEY simply ignored us, even when Screwllum gave THEM each a simulated personality and maxed out THEIR social tendency stat.
:::'''Herta:''' So we decided a different approach... with you.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Возврат}} I still have some questions...
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Simulated Universe...
::::'''Herta:''' Got some questions?
::::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What exactly does it simulate?
